---
import EnglishLayout from "../../layouts/EnglishLayout.astro";
---
<EnglishLayout title="GuestSafe | Hospitality inside proTcity" description="GuestSafe connects hospitality communication in Studio with the existing proTcity app: guest information, events, FAQs, City Guide and inbox.">
  <section class="en-hero"><div class="container"><p class="en-kicker">Hospitality · Powered by proTcity Studio</p><h1>A better-informed stay. No separate guest app.</h1><p class="en-lead">GuestSafe brings property information, guest communications and local guidance into proTcity. Hospitality teams work in Studio; guests use the app they can download from the official stores.</p><div class="en-actions"><a class="glass-button glass-button--primary" href="/en/contact">Discuss GuestSafe for your property</a><a class="glass-button" href="/en/download">Get the proTcity app</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="en-section"><div class="container"><div class="en-intro"><p class="en-kicker">One connected experience</p><h2>Prepare in Studio. Share with your guests.</h2></div>
    <div class="en-grid">
      <article class="en-card"><h3>Property information</h3><p>Prepare guest communications, events and frequently asked questions in Studio. Keep practical information together throughout the stay.</p></article>
      <article class="en-card"><h3>Local guidance</h3><p>Offer a property City Guide and relevant information about the surrounding area, alongside the urban context available in proTcity.</p></article>
      <article class="en-card"><h3>Guest inbox</h3><p>Keep hospitality communications accessible inside the app, according to the property's enabled services and access rules.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="en-section en-section--tint"><div class="container en-grid en-grid--two">
    <article class="en-card"><h2>How access works</h2><ol><li>The property configures its hospitality experience in Studio.</li><li>The guest follows the property's access instructions, including its QR flow where provided.</li><li>Guest access depends on consent, stay verification and applicable room permissions.</li></ol><p>Guests use the existing proTcity app; there is no separate GuestSafe app to install.</p></article>
    <article class="en-card"><h2>Plans and language support</h2><p>GuestSafe availability and service limits depend on the property's plan and configuration. Check GuestSafe eligibility with the team before choosing a plan, including the free Presenza plan.</p><p>Translation features, where enabled, support review. Optional automatic translation may be an additional service.</p><a href="https://studio.protcity.com/prezzi">Check current plans (Italian) →</a></article>
  </div></section>
  <section class="en-section"><div class="container"><h2>Bring useful information closer to your guests.</h2><div class="en-actions"><a class="glass-button glass-button--primary" href="/en/contact">Contact the partnership team</a><a class="glass-button" href="/en/partner">Explore Studio</a></div><div class="en-statement"><p>GuestSafe is a hospitality information and communication experience. It is not an emergency response service and does not guarantee a guest's safety.</p></div></div></section>
</EnglishLayout>
